{"h":3396,"lines":[{"y":0.040636042637446357,"c":1,"w":0.23251029968261716,"h":0.016195524146054185,"t":"Sample Writing answers","x":0.06995884173817106},{"y":0.083065176220818993,"h":0.025777753868147957,"t":"TEST 3, WRITING TASK 2","x":0.069622739222895691,"w":0.36281321207682293,"c":1},{"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 7.0 score.","h":0.021635044309079254,"x":0.069793893257218728,"c":1,"w":0.69987080891927078,"y":0.11968512945186005},{"t":"Today high levels of sugar are contained in many sources of food, especially in manufactured food.","h":0.024642656773363858,"w":0.82952748616536454,"y":0.14166993758224,"x":0.069793869637886322,"c":1},{"x":0.071817873703953025,"t":"And, of course, eating so much sugar is not good for our health: it can cause just a simple cavy, for","y":0.16089523715770448,"w":0.83790629069010425,"h":0.026619703384956561,"c":1},{"x":0.069832953830252981,"y":0.18182056479146713,"h":0.023490811405249223,"w":0.82948582967122397,"c":1,"t":"example, but also worse problems, like the increasing level of sugar in blood. Some people suggest"},{"c":1,"x":0.069749570676805248,"y":0.20147773394241231,"w":0.69381088256835932,"h":0.025949933082391796,"t":"that sugary products should be more expensive, so people would buy less of them."},{"t":"According to me, I think that this solution is not the best one as sugary products include some","y":0.22575915260642399,"x":0.071852724389529304,"w":0.79867772420247396,"h":0.023464472470772102,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.83367833455403639,"t":"types of food that we eat everyday, such as bread or pasta. This foods, particularly the first one, are","x":0.071833105947982284,"h":0.024007114280098607,"y":0.24502683782983858},{"h":0.023580879148521472,"x":0.071857034232668204,"y":0.2654569843033836,"c":1,"t":"really important in our diet, so make them more expensive will influence not only our litestyle, but","w":0.82132949829101554},{"x":0.071883446741751789,"y":0.28481320984391734,"h":0.022508497653776938,"c":1,"w":0.81098546346028644,"t":"also some people wouldn't be able anymore to buy the most important food for them. Just think"},{"h":0.024969035801252759,"c":1,"y":0.30361479631148081,"w":0.84196095784505198,"t":"for example to poor people, who can maybe afford a few loads of bread per day: what would they eat","x":0.07183682465972055},{"y":0.32848837246885598,"t":"if we increased bread price?","w":0.23868311564127603,"x":0.072016466863745021,"c":1,"h":0.018979236571331048},{"c":1,"t":"I think that the best solution for this problem would be informing people about what they eat, because","w":0.83357625325520834,"h":0.022885650571861316,"x":0.07189707895229068,"y":0.3485449527130402},{"t":"sometimes we don't even know that. They have already done something to inform people about the","w":0.80246912638346335,"c":1,"y":0.36918604689209089,"x":0.072016465875153035,"h":0.018917604947399136},{"x":0.07390996443314729,"y":0.38719943343486762,"w":0.81927973429361978,"h":0.023851736133876367,"c":1,"t":"characteristics of food, of course, and lebels are one of the most important thing, as they tell you all"},{"y":0.40721473137779685,"x":0.073956308540011173,"t":"the ingredients of a particular food. Yet, not many people spend some of their time reading lebels, or,","c":1,"h":0.02324370753779148,"w":0.82941304524739579},{"w":0.82951538085937493,"c":1,"t":"if they do it, they probably don't know the biggest part of the substances named in the list, as well not","x":0.07395161031673031,"y":0.42782616174939947,"h":0.023476878099924492},{"c":1,"t":"everybody knows that there is a specific order of the ingredients in the list. So something we could","w":0.80484222412109374,"h":0.023177040198947285,"x":0.073928074542585778,"y":0.44733918878333445},{"h":0.02674867182934948,"y":0.46507282656947013,"w":0.80081776936848958,"t":"do is organizing some 'talks\" to inform people not only about the function of lebels, but especially","c":1,"x":0.07388489221311223},{"t":"about the big amount of sugar we eat everyday. I think as well that this talks should be organised also","x":0.073908495763493148,"w":0.8316515096028646,"h":0.025740312322430126,"c":1,"y":0.48658200044078448},{"x":0.073935069147924817,"y":0.50637467050841867,"h":0.023208373286558337,"c":1,"t":"in schools, because also children must be aware of what they eat; besides, children can tell what they","w":0.82127787272135411},{"w":0.73456792195638021,"h":0.020381365844582833,"t":"have learned by these \"conferences\" at their parents, so the whole family would eat better.","x":0.07407406366982229,"y":0.52761627888174134,"c":1},{"x":0.07390322363877469,"h":0.026448058857373002,"c":1,"w":0.81519404093424486,"y":0.54971241729648801,"t":"To sum it up, I think that it is not necessary to increase the prices of sugary food and that all we"},{"t":"need is information, that will lead people to eat less sugary food and, as a consequence, live better","y":0.56976770209298322,"x":0.075974050012140609,"w":0.82748936971028642,"c":1,"h":0.024494627198847208},{"t":"with less problems.","c":1,"x":0.075924564681523019,"h":0.019706490183045156,"w":0.16494468688964842,"y":0.5943030403936137},{"h":0.014575971731448756,"t":"Here is the examiner's comment:","x":0.078189294971895959,"w":0.31275721232096354,"c":1,"y":0.62499999986450727},{"h":0.020967829494229262,"w":0.76778167724609392,"c":1,"x":0.12537961015224625,"t":"This is a good response to the question. It does not agree with the statement and","y":0.64382406433269035},{"c":1,"t":"presents a different solution to the problem.","y":0.66424418589271561,"w":0.41563786824544274,"h":0.01598837238037687,"x":0.12345678604449224},{"h":0.024479231368245702,"y":0.68315641074396671,"x":0.12532892483634575,"w":0.72675150553385415,"c":1,"t":"There are four paragraphs, made up of an introduction, a conclusion and two"},{"w":0.78017517089843746,"h":0.022337694471379455,"x":0.12329174902183089,"t":"further paragraphs explaining why the candidate disagrees with the statement and","y":0.70066646612193917,"c":1},{"h":0.019681046511736522,"c":1,"y":0.71899230240468814,"x":0.12338291857786488,"t":"then giving an alternative solution. Ideas are logically organised, with a range of","w":0.75941431681315108},{"y":0.73541756067175057,"h":0.020753296581398684,"c":1,"x":0.12335586928494413,"t":"linking devices to make the response easier to read [Yet | as well | \/ think as well","w":0.7657050069173178},{"c":1,"t":"that | as a consequence], but there are some errors [This \/ these | also].","y":0.75311151775339202,"w":0.68136011759440107,"x":0.12535277102652723,"h":0.021635695818035039},{"w":0.75334640502929695,"x":0.12539922750061228,"c":1,"y":0.77569444787574471,"t":"There are 386 words in this response, well over the expected 250 words. In this","h":0.021237453105733328},{"w":0.75136128743489583,"x":0.12535090528379234,"y":0.79220536300907862,"t":"case, the increased wordcount results in a good range of vocabulary with some","c":1,"h":0.022111094040078716},{"t":"flexibility and collocation [informing people about what they eat | aware of what they","y":0.8105913238016883,"w":0.79240310668945324,"c":1,"x":0.1254153182862989,"h":0.021145284807724152},{"c":1,"w":0.621593271891276,"t":"eat] despite some remaining errors [cavy \/ cavity | lebels \/ labels].","h":0.019535192752474284,"y":0.82897316018495881,"x":0.12745112981609263},{"h":0.018319443903766941,"c":1,"t":"The response uses a variety ot structures [what would they eat if we increased","x":0.12744344589061504,"y":0.85209253607324131,"w":0.74310012817382809},{"t":"bread price?] despite some errors [by these \"conferences\"\/ at these \"conferences' |","y":0.86523608190098888,"w":0.79256637573242195,"c":1,"x":0.12738953181941365,"h":0.023458192149095947},{"t":"less problems \/ fewer problems].","y":0.88808139518133233,"w":0.31481480916341142,"h":0.017441860778592888,"c":1,"x":0.12551440609629055},{"c":1,"t":"136","y":0.91424418589048317,"x":0.082304527346464151,"w":0.037037035